\newlabel{fig:scatter}{{3}{8}{Left: Predicted vs.\ human scores on the 90-sample test set. Points on the diagonal indicate perfect agreement. ConceptGrade (blue) clusters tightly around perfect agreement. Right: Ground-truth score distribution (0--5 scale) for the development split ($n = 30$), shown for reference; the test set distribution is representative}{figure.3}{}}
