\newlabel{tab:significance}{{IV}{8}{Wilcoxon Signed-Rank Test: ConceptGrade vs.\ LLM Baseline. $W_+$ = sum of positive signed ranks (over $50$ non-zero paired differences after dropping $70$ ties). Both two-tailed and one-tailed (directional, $\text {err}_{\text {C5}} < \text {err}_{\text {C\_LLM}}$) $p$-values reported}{table.4}{}}
